{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/z-index/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Z-index","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use our low-level <code>z-index</code> utilities to quickly change the stack level of an element or component."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>z-index</code> utilities to stack elements on top of one another. Requires a <code>position</code> value other than <code>static</code>, which can be set with custom styles or using our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/position/\">position utilities</a>."},{"id":"example--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"example--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"We call these “low-level” <code>z-index</code> utilities because of their default values of <code>-1</code> through <code>3</code>, which we use for the layout of overlapping components. High-level <code>z-index</code> values are used for overlay components like modals and tooltips."}]},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"1a5e31c52791754fe23a","height":300},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"z-3 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-3</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-2 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-2</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-1 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-1</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-0 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-0</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-n1 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-n1</span></div>","language":"html"},{"id":"overlays","type":"heading","en":"Overlays","level":2},{"id":"overlays--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap overlay components—dropdown, modal, offcanvas, popover, toast, and tooltip—all have their own <code>z-index</code> values to ensure a usable experience with competing “layers” of an interface."},{"id":"overlays--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Read about them in the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/z-index\"><code>z-index</code> layout page</a>."},{"id":"component-approach","type":"heading","en":"Component approach","level":2},{"id":"component-approach--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"On some components, we use our low-level <code>z-index</code> values to manage repeating elements that overlap one another (like buttons in a button group or items in a list group)."},{"id":"component-approach--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Learn about our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/extend/approach#z-index-scales\"><code>z-index</code> approach</a>."},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-maps","type":"heading","en":"Sass maps","level":3},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Customize this Sass map to change the available values and generated utilities."},{"id":"sass-maps--code-1","type":"code","value":"$zindex-levels: (\n  n1: -1,\n  0: 0,\n  1: 1,\n  2: 2,\n  3: 3\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Position utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"z-index\": (\n  property: z-index,\n  class: z,\n  values: $zindex-levels,\n)","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"1a5e31c52791754fe23a","html":" <div class=\"z-3 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-3</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-2 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-2</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-1 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-1</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-0 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-0</span></div>\n<div class=\"z-n1 position-absolute p-5 rounded-3\"><span>z-n1</span></div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bd-example-zindex-levels position-relative"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/vite"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rfs"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rtl"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contribute"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/options"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color"},{"en":"Color modes","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color-modes"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/components"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/css-variables"},{"en":"Optimize","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/optimize"},{"en":"Breakpoints","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/breakpoints"},{"en":"Containers","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/containers"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://